			"notes": "a bunch of quality of life stuff that I deem sorta not really important\n\n## Changelog\n- Now uses head offset to support player animations.\n- Some mouth positions now transition to themselves for a more authentic BFDI experience.\n- There is now a special mouth expression for being underwater.\n- There is now a special mouth for being poisoned. (I wanted to add a green filter over the player but I do not know how to do that.)\n- Added a config.\n- You can now disable the mouth in config.\n- You can now change the speed of the mouth and disable its transitions in config.\n- You can now transform the mouth manually on your character in config."
